<p>
The Libre-Halaal Foundation is not a membership organization.

</p>
<p>
The Libre-Halaal Foundation is an open international community of
network engineers, mobile device manufacturers, wireless-IP network
operators, and researchers who are concerned with wireless-IP
technology.  It is open to any interested company, organization, or
individual.<br>
</p>
<p>There are several ways to participate:<br>
</p>
<ul>
  <li>Declare your free protocols patent-free</li>
  <li>Join LHF mailing lists</li>
  <li>Attend any LHF events/activities</li>
  <li><a href="donation">Make a tax deductible contribution</a><br>
  </li>
</ul>
